Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.87,0:00:07.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can see you're already getting comfortable for our fireside chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.55,0:00:12.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also, also a bartender.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.27,0:00:22.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Chanza, if you could swap jobs with Jensen for just a day, what would you do first, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a great idea to to swap the jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:27.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Would you like to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:31.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,No. Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:34.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,I I give you my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.11,0:00:39.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,I rather would put my leather jacket on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.07,0:00:41.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would take a flight to Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.95,0:00:49.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like to see the German chancellor and I would tell him I'm ready to invest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:52.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, that's exactly what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:55.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think we could arrange a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:58.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, nobody has invested more in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:00:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:00.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are really grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.71,0:01:04.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for doing this and this is a great signal for our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.51,0:01:05.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.07,0:01:05.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.02,0:01:12.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh you you know uh Nvidia's story and Germany's story uh played a very large role.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:18.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh in fact in the year 2000 Nvidia was a consumer oriented technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.73,0:01:20.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were only building for PC gaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.93,0:01:29.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it was a company in Germany, Elsa, that partners, that partnership led us into workstations, which led us into all of the car companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.95,0:01:39.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today we work with the car companies from styling, design, engineering, simulation, manufacturing all the way out to the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.31,0:01:44.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was in 2005 that Audi brought us into the car industry inside the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:49.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it was uh 2023, was it 2023?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:02:00.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,2020 uh yeah 2020 that Ola and I established a partnership to build autonomous vehicles and so Germany and video has been very close for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,J I think I already heard that you wouldn't like to swap jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:08.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,So I won't even get there asking you what you would do as a chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.30,0:02:09.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,We let you be you for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:16.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I suspect you can already picture things that we might not even imagine yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.06,0:02:21.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,So take us into an engineering office or a factory of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.19,0:02:21.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:23.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are this going to look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.03,0:02:25.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:32.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh in fact, the factory, every single company in the future will have two factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.15,0:02:35.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The factory that is real and the factory that is digital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:40.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the factory that is digital will be so real it might as be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.83,0:02:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,if it manifests itself when you create the digital twin of your company, of your car company, that digital twin might as well be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:03:00.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so in the future, I believe that most people here in Germany will mostly work inside a digital twin of their company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.83,0:03:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,They will build digital cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:05.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those cars will have digital brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.23,0:03:11.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,The manufacturing the factories will have digital of course artificial intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:18.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,robots building inside a robotic factory building cars that will be robotic
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:26.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,and everything will be completely software driven everything will be completely AIdriven so every company will build two things they will build brains
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.15,0:03:33.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the brains that go into uh the products that they that they ship and so fascinating yeah it's going to be cool
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.15,0:03:44.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,chanc of course the ambition is to bring AI into everyday use across German industry from large manufacturers Middleton to also smaller firms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:47.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could you perhaps share a few concrete examples of how you and the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:54.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,German government are ensuring that this widespread uh deployment is actually taking place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:54.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:04:04.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,First of all, I would like to say that I'm really impressed what um Nvidia and German companies are already doing in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.07,0:04:09.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh Ola Kelenius just handed out a model from the new S-Class of Mercedes to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:18.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh promising that this car will be autonomous driving in Germany by the end of this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.59,0:04:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Safest and the most autonomous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:28.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is happening in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.11,0:04:30.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we are in the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:37.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are fully committed to be one of the most advanced places in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:45.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,not just in the European Union, but in the world to work with EI, AI, to integrate AI into our industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:51.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,And one of the biggest, if not the biggest advantage we have in Germany is our so-called middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:05:00.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm very happy to see that we are having here tonight many smaller and mediumsized companies from Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:09.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please open your doors for AI to make use of your data.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:12.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is so decisive for the German future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:19.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a real secret and a real advantage for Germany to use
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,to make use of all the data which are already available in our companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:33.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if we could combine this AI with companies like yours and our companies in Germany, the big ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,but also the so-called middle, I'm really optimistic that we will be one of the leading,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:49.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,if not the leading country in the world in terms of spread AI for all the companies of our manufacturers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:54.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,machinery, automotive industry, suppliers of automotive industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:58.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think this is a great opportunity and I'm delighted to meet that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:06:03.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:09.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,So So, so first of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:16.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,the data of Germany is part of your natural resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.07,0:06:18.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,It belongs to the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:23.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,The data of your the the digital experience or otherwise known as data.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:32.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,The data of your country is your culture, your values, your knowledge, your experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:33.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's your natural resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:37.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It belongs to the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:48.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you're absolutely right that you should import the technology to harvest that data and turn it into your national intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.27,0:06:54.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you should not export your culture, export your values, export your knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.99,0:07:00.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,export your history, and then import German intelligence back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:01.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.53,0:07:02.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you you out of you you have every you're going to of course use the best AI technology
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.05,0:07:15.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,available in the world and AI services in the world but you have every capability to build your own AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:23.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second is the next wave of AI is physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.91,0:07:27.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is where AI interacts with the physical world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.42,0:07:37.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,robotics, manufacturing, cars, heavy industry that will never be replaced by digital technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:45.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,The work that you know belongs that knowledge belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:50.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The expertise of your domain that belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.44,0:07:56.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Artificial general intelligence will never replace domain expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:08:01.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could be as smart of a general intelligence as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will never be as smart as somebody who is very very specialized in a particular field of electro mechanical technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.04,0:08:13.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,It cannot be replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:16.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so AI can only augment your capability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:18.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will not replace your capability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.88,0:08:22.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,So take advantage of the technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.19,0:08:28.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a new instrument.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:35.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for some of these advantages, um Jensen, we have on the one hand decades of industrial data.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.98,0:08:39.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have very um skilled labor if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:42.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have the engineering expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.65,0:08:48.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um so this certainly as um you seem to point out uh speaks for a lot of advantages for Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:50.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have a global perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.35,0:08:55.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, there are other countries that also have strengths that also like to take advantage of their strengths.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:59.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,You talk to so many governments across the globe to so many companies across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:04.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you take this global perspective,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.59,0:09:13.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,how is Germany braced for this sort of next race in AI?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:22.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you know, the last major industrial revolution was electrification before the one I'll describe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.51,0:09:32.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Electrification resulted in really three geographical leaders,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.27,0:09:35.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Germany, United States, Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:45.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,For the last 50 years, because of the current industrial revolution, which is computing and digital technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.95,0:09:55.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,United States has largely exported its heavy manufacturing, its building, its craft really to China.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:10:05.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,So now the world has three again, but it's Germany, Japan, and China.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:12.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,The advantage that China has is that they came into their industrial revolution, if you will,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:19.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,their economic transformation happened during precisely the time of the computer industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.63,0:10:22.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are quite computerized.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:34.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,China is probably the only nation today that is deep in manufacturing and deep in computer science and very comfortable in both.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:38.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, the good news is there's a complete reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:42.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,The last 50 years was about software programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.82,0:10:47.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,United States is obviously world class.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,But there's a new era now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:52.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,The computer programs itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:56.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just have to show the computer what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.27,0:11:06.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Computer programming all of the advantages of the last generation has now been acred into artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:10.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a complete reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:18.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the digital technology in the world will not replace electro mechanical physical technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:23.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Electrons will never replace atoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.07,0:11:25.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's an advantage that you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:33.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,The work you know, the domain expertise you have, the craft that is here, it will remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.77,0:11:36.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you have to take advantage of this new technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:41.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,This in this industrial revolution is so mighty, is so powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.63,0:11:51.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't have another chance because you've always Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:56.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether we have another chance or not, we should always assume we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:59.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,This transition is so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:07.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,You should combine your deep skills, your deep expertise in the physical products,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:13.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the electromechanical products and combine it with artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:24.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would not be surprised if currently most of the mishads their challenges are reduction in labor because people are getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.35,0:12:31.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,The craft of that is captured in the knowledge the skills of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.06,0:12:36.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,the people are still are starting to get older and older every generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:38.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take advantage of artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:39.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let them codify.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:41.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let them program.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:46.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let them teach this artificial intelligence and keep it here in Germany, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:54.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let it re-engineer the chancellor's words, chancellor's words, re-engineer Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:56.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is your chance to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.99,0:13:01.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:07.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think it's become obvious prerequisites to scale industrial AI in Germany um are
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.03,0:13:13.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,here and they are very promising and the opportunities related to it are impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.41,0:13:23.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will be key of course Chancellor to bridge the gap between innovation and implementation in factories and in value chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.31,0:13:30.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is a cooperation with Nvidia a part of the plan to do so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:31.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:33.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is already happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:44.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I would like to say that I'm extremely grateful about what we have just heard from um this this business leader of the world in terms of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:53.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you are giving me and hopefully us a great optimism about our business model in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.67,0:14:04.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you might know that I am always insisting that we have to remain a country with manufacturing and we
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:14.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,should never give up that and now we are seeing a great opportunity in combining our experiences with manufacturing and AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.61,0:14:22.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,So if we are successful in bringing these two aspects and parts of the business of the future together,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:29.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm really very optimistic that Germany can be one of the most successful economies in
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:36.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,the world because we are already we are still the third biggest economy in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:43.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,So thank you for for for telling us what the opportunity is and comparing us with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:48.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I believe and I I I I share your view that the Americans made a big mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.63,0:14:57.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,to export their manufacturing and now they are faced with a very small successful but very smallbased industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.01,0:15:05.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is our advantage to have this broader access and broader approach to the future of our industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:14.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,And look, um, I'm I'm a large American company and, um, and we, uh, have incredible partnerships here in Germany for good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:15.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:17.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:21.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, our partnership with Audi led to our partnership with Mercedes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:28.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our partnership with Mercedes led to our investment in robotics, which led to our partnership with Agile Robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:30.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,We just made an investment in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.19,0:15:40.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we made investment uh Ailios made an investment in uh Murilla uh made an investment in um uh uh reflex aerospace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:45.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh last year we made an investment in Black Forest Labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:51.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh here in Germany you have deep science and technology and deep science and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:57.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,math which are the fundamentals for manufacturing for the deep sciences for artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.39,0:16:03.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so there's so much there's so much technical expertise and there's so much deep science and deep math.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The one thing that you said also is that you believed in a policy of advancing and encouraging AI startups or startups in general.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:13.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think that's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:19.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the things that I really love about the United States, of course, is that we constantly reinvigorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:21.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,We constantly reinvent ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:24.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the way we do that is through all the entrepreneurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.27,0:16:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so one of the things that I really love to see, we've invested tremendously in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:33.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the last year, we've invested almost a billion dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:36.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,This week, we're investing in four new companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.58,0:16:39.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, in a lot of ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:49.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are one of the largest VCs in Germany because I believe in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:59.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and so for all of the other venture capitalists, you better hurry because otherwise I'm going to take all the good deals and I'm going to be rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.03,0:17:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so and so the the important thing is is the the thing I want
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.97,0:17:09.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,to recognize is that the science and technology capability of Germany is just second to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:11.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a thousand employees here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:13.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a fantastic office here in Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.69,0:17:19.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some of the fundamental inventions of our companies came from our office here in Berlin and Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:22.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is you want to invest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:23.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,May I ask a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.45,0:17:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could you give us an advice on regulation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:35.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are having a very strong debate in Brussels on the European level compared to the US.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:41.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is the best way to regulate this industry or this new technology?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.15,0:17:46.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think we agree on no regulation is not the right answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:51.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Too tight regulation is not the right answer either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:58.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,But what is from your view the right answer in terms of keeping
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:04.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the potential damage in mind that this could happen and it already happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.37,0:18:06.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what is your advice on on regulation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.72,0:18:09.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,What can we do better than others?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:11.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Safety is paramount.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.39,0:18:21.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there is no future for this industry without safe products just as there's no future in autonomous vehicles if the vehicles are not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.14,0:18:23.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so it is not a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.05,0:18:26.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't choose between safety and capability.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.43,0:18:27.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:30.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have to go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:32.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so three pillars.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:38.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first is you can't regulate if there's no technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:43.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the technology industry must Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.03,0:18:49.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The technology industry must invent the technology for safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:55.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as Ola and I had to invent the technology and we have the safest autonomous vehicle in the car in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.90,0:19:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We had to invent the technology that allows you to achieve the functionality you want to see
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.73,0:19:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,but also the guarantee of functional safety and active safety we want to we want to deliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that requires invention of technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:12.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the first pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.11,0:19:14.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,But that's something that Germany is incredibly good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.66,0:19:18.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your science, your math, your technology is incredibly good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:21.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have to invent the technology of safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:23.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Safety is not hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:26.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Safety is technology and engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:31.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second, the companies need to have best practices.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:38.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sometimes the the young companies they're still trying to grow up and they make maybe more mistakes than they should.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.62,0:19:45.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um we need to make sure that companies make deliver on the best practices,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.26,0:19:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,best methods and even in safety as many of the people in the audience there are probably many in the automotive industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.65,0:19:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know that safety is deep methodology, deep best practices,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:20:02.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,deep engineering and that methodology has to be adhered to and then lastly
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:10.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,there's industrial and government regulations if it turns out that and remember AI is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:16.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,two things just as the internet regulating the internet is hard but regulating
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.43,0:20:22.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,internet applications is not so hard we should be regulating the applications right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, uh, if there are AI technologies, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:33.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,that you see that's being applied to a new type of product that is not covered by the existing regulatory bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.11,0:20:39.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,they have to re they have to evaluate as soon as possible and make sure that they their regulation includes AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.27,0:20:48.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, I would and I I think I've also heard you say that you want to find that balance between innovation and regulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.51,0:20:52.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to regulate if the industry doesn't thrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:59.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want the German AI industry to thrive as well as do it safely, responsibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:02.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,So I think I think the balance is really important to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:10.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I think that the answer is we know there's technology we can invent and deploy in order to have AI safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.43,0:21:15.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,We know that there are best practices that we can adhere to as companies and industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.14,0:21:20.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then in addition to that if necessary we'll make sure we regulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.43,0:21:25.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just briefly chancer what would be your answer to the same question maybe very briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:32.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,No thank you this was extremely helpful because we we are talking about that on the European level we are talking that on the national level and my
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:36.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,my approach is that we at least need the European level and better we
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:44.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,had a global level of regulation and of safety for this fantastic new technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.40,0:21:48.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is my personal view but we we are still far from that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:53.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,because we are different having a different approach between the Americans and the Europeans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.47,0:21:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we are working on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.17,0:22:05.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And most in this room know that um I was successful to get the AI regulation out of the normal regulation of AI in the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:09.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,European Union and to have a special regulation for the machinery industry in
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Germany and not part being part of the general AI limitation and regulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:17.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this was a big achievement which we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:18.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give Germany a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.59,0:22:19.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.31,0:22:22.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give this industry a chance to Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:33.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And just finally, very very briefly, Chancellor, if Jensen came back in a year's time, which we very much hope, what would you hope for him to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like to see him regularly um let's say at least once a year and discussing progresses we
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.20,0:22:51.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,made and seeing um a guy sitting in my office and being extremely happy about the German investment place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.31,0:23:00.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nothing would give me more joy than to see all of my investments in Germany turned into gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.43,0:23:00.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.81,0:23:10.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I have every I have every belief and I'm very very happy to hear uh your personal support of the startup ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.97,0:23:16.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm very happy to hear that that there are regulations involved to uh make it possible
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.98,0:23:23.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,for the pension funds and the and the risk capital the risk capital to come into Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.39,0:23:28.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then and then I'm I'm also I'm also uh super excited to hear about all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.22,0:23:32.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the AI startups and the startups that have happened in the last couple of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.11,0:23:37.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Half of the startups in Germany being founded in the last two years is AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.87,0:23:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.92,0:23:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's oriented.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.96,0:23:43.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's who knows maybe you are going to ask them for some autographs next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.86,0:23:49.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,You might want to pin a bring a pen when you come once they have their breakthroughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.47,0:23:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some of them uh I understand were your interns uh in the past and now they run their own companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.40,0:23:58.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's been a pleasure to have you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.18,0:23:59.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you to both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.42,0:24:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, please give a thank you an applause to Chancellor Mer and Jensen W.
